## 📌 Overview

**Nexora.AI** is an AI SaaS application designed to simplify common creative and professional tasks.

Instead of using multiple applications for writing, generating images, editing images, and reviewing resumes, users can access all of these capabilities from a single dashboard.

The application is built using the **PERN stack**:

```text
PostgreSQL + Express.js + React.js + Node.js
```

It also integrates third-party services such as:

- OpenAI for AI-powered generation
- Cloudinary for image storage and AI image transformations
- Clerk for authentication and user management
- Neon for serverless PostgreSQL hosting

---

# ✨ Features

## 🤖 AI Tools

| Tool | Description |
|---|---|
| ✍️ **Write Article** | Generate structured articles using a topic and user-defined parameters |
| #️⃣ **Blog Titles** | Generate creative and engaging blog title suggestions |
| 🎨 **Generate Images** | Convert text prompts into AI-generated images |
| 🪄 **Remove Background** | Automatically remove the background from an uploaded image |
| ✂️ **Remove Object** | Remove unwanted objects from an image using AI |
| 📄 **Review Resume** | Upload a PDF resume and receive AI-powered feedback and suggestions |

---

## 👤 User Features

### Secure Authentication

Authentication and user sessions are handled using **Clerk**.

Protected application routes verify the authenticated user before allowing access to AI services.

---

### 📊 Personal Dashboard

Users get a centralized dashboard where they can:

- Access all AI tools
- View their active plan
- Track generated creations
- View recent activity
- Navigate between different AI services

---

### 🌍 Community

Users can explore publicly shared AI-generated creations through the community section.

This allows users to discover content generated by other users of the platform.

---

### 📱 Responsive Interface

The frontend is built using **React and Tailwind CSS** and is designed to work across:

- Desktop
- Laptop
- Tablet
- Mobile

---

# 🧰 Tech Stack

## Frontend

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **React.js** | Building the user interface |
| **Vite** | Frontend development and build tool |
| **Tailwind CSS** | Responsive UI styling |
| **React Router DOM** | Client-side routing |
| **Axios** | Communication with backend APIs |
| **Lucide React** | UI icons |
| **React Hot Toast** | Notifications |
| **React Markdown** | Rendering AI-generated Markdown |
| **Clerk React** | Authentication and user sessions |

---

## Backend

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **Node.js** | JavaScript runtime |
| **Express.js** | REST API and backend routing |
| **PostgreSQL** | Relational database |
| **Neon** | Serverless PostgreSQL hosting |
| **OpenAI API** | AI-powered content/image generation |
| **Cloudinary** | Image storage and AI image transformations |
| **Multer** | Handling uploaded files |
| **PDF Parse** | Extracting text from resume PDFs |
| **CORS** | Frontend-backend communication |

