# 🏗️ Architecture

```text
                         ┌─────────────────┐
                         │     User        │
                         └────────┬────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                         ┌─────────────────┐
                         │ React Frontend  │
                         │    Nexora.AI    │
                         └────────┬────────┘
                                  │
                              REST API
                                  │
                                  ▼
                         ┌─────────────────┐
                         │ Express Backend │
                         └────────┬────────┘
                                  │
                ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┐
                │                 │                 │
                ▼                 ▼                 ▼
        ┌──────────────┐   ┌────────────┐   ┌────────────┐
        │    Clerk     │   │  OpenAI    │   │ Cloudinary │
        │     Auth     │   │    API     │   │ Image AI   │
        └──────────────┘   └────────────┘   └────────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                         ┌─────────────────┐
                         │ Neon PostgreSQL │
                         │    Database     │
                         └─────────────────┘
```

---

# 🔄 Application Flow

A normal AI request follows this flow:

```text
User
  ↓
React Frontend
  ↓
API Request
  ↓
Clerk Authentication
  ↓
Express Middleware
  ↓
AI Controller
  ↓
OpenAI / Cloudinary
  ↓
Result Generated
  ↓
Save Creation in PostgreSQL
  ↓
Return Response
  ↓
Display Result to User
```

---

# 🖼️ Image Editing Flow

Nexora.AI uses **Cloudinary AI transformations** for its image editing capabilities.

## Remove Background

```text
Upload Image
     ↓
Multer
     ↓
Express Controller
     ↓
Cloudinary Upload
     ↓
Background Removal AI
     ↓
Processed Image URL
     ↓
Save to PostgreSQL
     ↓
Display Result
```

Cloudinary automatically detects the main subject and removes the surrounding background.

---

## Remove Object

The user uploads an image and specifies the object they want to remove.

```text
Image + Object Name
        ↓
      Multer
        ↓
 Upload to Cloudinary
        ↓
     public_id
        ↓
 gen_remove transformation
        ↓
 Cloudinary Generative AI
        ↓
   Processed Image
        ↓
      Result
```

Cloudinary removes the specified object and reconstructs the missing portion using the surrounding image context.

---

# 📄 Resume Review Flow

```text
Upload Resume PDF
        ↓
      Multer
        ↓
    PDF Parser
        ↓
 Extract Resume Text
        ↓
      AI Model
        ↓
 Analyse Resume
        ↓
 Feedback + Suggestions
        ↓
 Display to User
```

The tool can provide feedback on areas such as resume structure, skills, content quality, and possible improvements.

